dentity_code, needs_code, count(*) from source_value_extractions group by 1,2) and is UNREVIEWED; the source names wheelchair users. No ICF or access-need tag is assigned.', '2026-10-30 22:02', 'session_2026-10-30-rest-landing-parameter', '2026-10-30 22:02', 'session_2026-10-30-rest-landing-parameter', 'claim', '<=');

